& [Purpose] is a buildable shape without premature building
  + assign one semantic responsibility to one exclusive module
  + serialize the few unavoidable shared-file changes
  + distinguish causal dependencies from project ordering
  + make future worker handoffs inspectable through records
  + preserve every missing gate and refuse implementation

& [AuthorityState] is formation_only
  + I02C is completed and may be cited as predecessor
  + I03 through I03E3 remain inactive formation or unsigned candidates
  + all I03 implementation verification and satisfaction counts remain zero
  + this specification issues no TouchLease InterfaceReceipt phase activation or execution authority

